="00:28.070">, </span><span begin="00:28.070" end="00:28.610">even </span><span begin="00:28.610" end="00:29.090">when </span><span begin="00:29.090" end="00:29.240">you </span><span begin="00:29.240" end="00:29.570">are </span><span begin="00:29.570" end="00:30.170">not </span><span begin="00:30.170" end="00:31.310">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.600" end="00:39.500"><span begin="00:32.600" end="00:34.010">If </span><span begin="00:34.010" end="00:34.400">there </span><span begin="00:34.400" end="00:34.580">are </span><span begin="00:34.580" end="00:35.930">boundaries</span><span begin="00:35.930" end="00:35.960">, </span><span begin="00:35.960" end="00:36.290">I </span><span begin="00:36.290" end="00:36.470">will </span><span begin="00:36.470" end="00:37.010">try </span><span begin="00:37.010" end="00:37.430">to </span><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:37.970">knock </span><span begin="00:37.970" end="00:38.450">them </span><span begin="00:38.450" end="00:39.500">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.400" end="00:43.820"><span begin="00:40.400" end="00:41.660">I</span><span begin="00:41.660" end="00:41.690">’</span><span begin="00:41.690" end="00:41.750">m </span><span begin="00:41.750" end="00:42.470">latching </span><span begin="00:42.470" end="00:42.860">on</span><span begin="00:42.860" end="00:42.860">, </span><span begin="00:42.860" end="00:43.550">babe</span><span begin="00:43.550" end="00:43.820">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.820" end="00:46.730"><span begin="00:43.820" end="00:44.210">Now </span><span begin="00:44.210" end="00:44.360">I </span><span begin="00:44.360" end="00:44.810">know </span><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:45.380">what </span><span begin="00:45.380" end="00:45.800">I </span><span begin="00:45.800" end="00:46.220">have </span><span begin="00:46.220" end="00:46.730">found</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.090" end="01:05.270"><span begin="01:02.090" end="01:02.480">I </span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.870">feel </span><span begin="01:02.870" end="01:03.110">we're </span><span begin="01:03.110" end="01:03.800">close </span><span begin="01:03.800" end="01:05.270">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.230" end="01:09.920"><span begin="01:06.230" end="01:06.470">I </span><span begin="01:06.470" end="01:07.010">wanna </span><span begin="01:07.010" end="01:07.370">lock </span><span begin="01:07.370" end="01:07.520">in </span><span begin="01:07.520" end="01:07.970">your </span><span begin="01:07.970" end="01:09.920">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.220" end="01:14.300"><span begin="01:10.220" end="01:10.340">I </span><span begin="01:10.340" end="01:10.730">think </span><span begin="01:10.730" end="01:10.880">we</span><span begin="01:10.880" end="01:10.910">’</span><span begin="01:10.910" end="01:10.970">re </span><span begin="01:10.970" end="01:11.570">close </span><span begin="01:11.570" end="01:14.300">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.330" end="01:17.390"><span begin="01:14.330" end="01:14.690">Could </span><span begin="01:14.690" end="01:14.840">I </span><span begin="01:14.840" end="01:15.230">lock </span><span begin="01:15.230" end="01:15.410">in </span><span begin="01:15.410" end="01:15.800">your </span><span begin="01:15.800" end="01:16.640">love</span><span begin="01:16.640" end="01:16.640">, </span><span begin="01:16.640" end="01:17.390">baby</span><span begin="01:17.390" end="01:17.390">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.390" end="01:23.330"><span begin="01:17.390" end="01:20.360">Now </span><span begin="01:20.360" end="01:20.750">I </span><span begin="01:20.750" end="01:21.410">got </span><span begin="01:21.410" end="01:21.860">you </span><span begin="01:21.860" end="01:22.340">in </span><span begin="01:22.340" end="01:22.610">my </span><span begin="01:22.610" end="01:23.330">space</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.480" end="01:25.730"><span begin="01:23.480" end="01:23.720">I </span><span begin="01:23.720" end="01:24.260">won</span><span begin="01:24.260" end="01:24.290">’</span><span begin="01:24.290" end="01:24.590">t </span><span begin="01:24.590" end="01:24.740">let </span><span begin="01:24.740" end="01:25.010">go </span><span begin="01:25.010" end="01:25.310">with </span><span begin="01:25.310" end="01:25.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.710" end="01:31.220"><span begin="01:27.710" end="01:28.280">Got </span><span begin="01:28.280" end="01:28.550">you </span><span begin="01:28.550" end="01:29.270">shackled </span><span begin="01:29.270" end="01:29.660">in </span><span begin="01:29.660" end="01:30.230">my </span><span begin="01:30.230" end="01:31.220">embrace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.340" end="01:33.110"><span begin="01:31.340" end="01:31.370">I</span><span begin="01:31.370" end="01:31.460">’</span><span begin="01:31.460" end="01:31.580">m </span><span begin="01:31.580" end="01:32.660">latching </span><span begin="01:32.660" end="01:33.020">onto </span><span begin="01:33.020" end="01:33.110">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.400" end="01:39.170"><span begin="01:34.400" end="01:36.080">Now </span><span begin="01:36.080" end="01:36.470">I </span><span begin="01:36.470" end="01:37.160">got </span><span begin="01:37.160" end="01:37.580">you </span><span begin="01:37.580" end="01:38.060">in </span><span begin="01:38.060" end="01:38.330">my </span><span begin="01:38.330" end="01:39.170">space</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.200" end="01:41.690"><span begin="01:39.200" end="01:39.440">I </span><span begin="01:39.440" end="01:40.010">won</span><span begin="01:40.010" end="01:40.040">’</span><span begin="01:40.040" end="01:40.100">t </span><span begin="01:40.100" end="01:40.460">let </span><span begin="01:40.460" end="01:40.760">go </span><span begin="01:40.760" end="01:41.060">with </span><span begin="01:41.060" end="01:41.690">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.400" end="01:46.910"><span begin="