:13.850"><span begin="02:06.950" end="02:08.450">How </span><span begin="02:08.450" end="02:08.750">do </span><span begin="02:08.750" end="02:08.960">you </span><span begin="02:08.960" end="02:09.530">do </span><span begin="02:09.530" end="02:10.160">it</span><span begin="02:10.160" end="02:10.190">, </span><span begin="02:10.190" end="02:10.370">you </span><span begin="02:10.370" end="02:10.730">got </span><span begin="02:10.730" end="02:10.940">me </span><span begin="02:10.940" end="02:11.990">losing </span><span begin="02:11.990" end="02:12.890">every </span><span begin="02:12.890" end="02:13.850">breath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.810" end="02:21.800"><span begin="02:14.810" end="02:16.340">What </span><span begin="02:16.340" end="02:16.670">did </span><span begin="02:16.670" end="02:16.820">you </span><span begin="02:16.820" end="02:17.330">give </span><span begin="02:17.330" end="02:18.080">me </span><span begin="02:18.080" end="02:18.260">to </span><span begin="02:18.260" end="02:18.560">make </span><span begin="02:18.560" end="02:18.770">my </span><span begin="02:18.770" end="02:19.280">heart </span><span begin="02:19.280" end="02:19.850">beat </span><span begin="02:19.850" end="02:20.300">out </span><span begin="02:20.300" end="02:20.690">my </span><span begin="02:20.690" end="02:21.800">chest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.050" end="02:39.980"><span begin="02:36.050" end="02:36.890">I </span><span begin="02:36.890" end="02:37.280">feel </span><span begin="02:37.280" end="02:37.520">we're </span><span begin="02:37.520" end="02:38.240">close </span><span begin="02:38.240" end="02:39.980">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.580" end="02:44.330"><span begin="02:40.580" end="02:40.880">I </span><span begin="02:40.880" end="02:41.420">wanna </span><span begin="02:41.420" end="02:41.810">lock </span><span begin="02:41.810" end="02:41.960">in </span><span begin="02:41.960" end="02:42.380">your </span><span begin="02:42.380" end="